# Map selection over the skirmish screen (Select Map): the shared dialog block. The legacy parent window covered
# 442..1920 x 18..580 units, which left the button row outside it, so it is moved over the dialog first.
hide $SkirmishMapSelectMenuParent
window $SkirmishMapSelectMenuParent left top 460 220 1000 640
include MapSelectDialog.layout
